  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An exchange of staff between grassroot organisations in India and Nepal which works to improve the livelihood of marginalised communities. The project will strengthen the organisations&#x2019; capacities to provide quality vocational training to women, aiming to improve the quality of their handicraft and increase the marketing of their products. India and Nepal.</narrative>
  </description>
